#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`rtsp` --- rtsp library"
msgstr ":mod:`rtsp` --- libreria rtsp"

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``rtsp`` module on the OpenMV Cam allows you to stream video from your "
"OpenMV Cam to any compatible RTSP client (like `VLC "
"<https://www.videolan.org/vlc/index.html>`_)."
msgstr ""
"Il modulo ``rtsp`` sull'OpenMV Cam consente di trasmettere video in "
"streaming dalla propria OpenMV Cam a qualsiasi client RTSP compatibile (come"
" `VLC <https://www.videolan.org/vlc/index.html>`_\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:10
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Esempio::"

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:37
msgid "Connect a client to ``rtsp://<camera-ip>:554/`` to view the stream."
msgstr ""
"Collegare un client a ``rtsp://<camera-ip>:554/`` per visualizzare lo "
"stream."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:41
msgid "class rtsp_server -- rtsp_server class"
msgstr "classe rtsp_server -- classe rtsp_server"

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:43
msgid ""
"The `rtsp_server` class creates a single connection RTSP web server on your "
"OpenMV Cam."
msgstr ""
"La classe `rtsp_server` crea un server web RTSP a connessione singola sulla "
"propria OpenMV Cam."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:47
msgid "Creates an RTSP server bound to ``network_if``."
msgstr "Crea un server RTSP collegato a ``network_if``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:49
msgid ""
"``network_if`` is the network module interface created from "
"``network.LAN()``, ``network.WLAN()``, or similar."
msgstr ""
"``network_if`` è l'interfaccia del modulo di rete creata da "
"``network.LAN()``\\ , ``network.WLAN()`` o simili."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:52
msgid "``port`` is the TCP port to listen on. The default RTSP port is 554."
msgstr ""
"``port`` è la porta TCP su cui ascoltare. La porta RTSP predefinita è 554."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:56
msgid ""
"Bind a callback ``cb`` to be invoked when a client sets up an RTSP "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Associa un callback ``cb`` da invocare quando un client imposta una "
"connessione RTSP."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:58
msgid ""
"The callback receives ``pathname`` (the requested stream resource path, "
"defaults to ``\"/\"``) and ``session`` (a random session id)."
msgstr ""
"Il callback riceve ``pathname`` (il percorso della risorsa di stream "
"richiesta, il valore predefinito è ``\"/\"``\\ ) e ``session`` (un id di "
"sessione casuale)."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:63
msgid "Bind a callback ``cb`` to be invoked when a client starts streaming."
msgstr ""
"Associa un callback ``cb`` da invocare quando un client avvia lo streaming."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:65 ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:74
#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:81
msgid ""
"The callback receives ``pathname`` and ``session`` as described in "
":meth:`register_setup_cb`."
msgstr ""
"Il callback riceve ``pathname`` e ``session`` come descritto in "
":meth:`register_setup_cb`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:70
msgid "Bind a callback ``cb`` to be invoked when a client pauses streaming."
msgstr ""
"Associa un callback ``cb`` da invocare quando un client mette in pausa lo "
"streaming."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:72
msgid "Note: VLC's pause button does not actually notify the server."
msgstr ""
"Nota: il pulsante di pausa di VLC non notifica effettivamente il server."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:79
msgid ""
"Bind a callback ``cb`` to be invoked when a client tears down the RTSP "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Associa un callback ``cb`` da invocare quando un client chiude la "
"connessione RTSP."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:86
msgid "Starts running the `rtsp_server` logic and does not return."
msgstr "Avvia l'esecuzione della logica `rtsp_server` e non ritorna."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:88
msgid ""
"``image_callback`` is invoked to produce each frame and must return an "
"`image.Image` object. It receives ``pathname`` and ``session`` as described "
"in `rtsp_server.register_setup_cb()`."
msgstr ""
"``image_callback`` viene invocato per produrre ogni frame e deve restituire "
"un oggetto `image.Image`\\ . Riceve ``pathname`` e ``session`` come "
"descritto in `rtsp_server.register_setup_cb()`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.rtsp.rst:91
msgid "``quality`` is the JPEG compression quality used while streaming."
msgstr ""
"``quality`` è la qualità di compressione JPEG usata durante lo streaming."
